WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- See your new movie,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.040
I loved the original "Sonic the Hedgehog,"

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.890
was played so much in our
house, this one will as well.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.375
So thank you for that, for a new movie.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:08.208
(chuckling)

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.610
But the new movie, so what's it about?

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:15.026
- Well, we get to see Sonic
in a new world playing

00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:16.780
and doing the things that we saw before,

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.830
but it's bigger, better, and faster.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.663
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:19.663 --> 00:00:22.890
- My character is Rachel
and my sister is Maddie

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.083
played by the incredible Tika Sumpter.

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:25.916
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:25.916 --> 00:00:28.420
- And my fiance is Shemar Moore.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.700
(audience applauding)

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.130
- I know I'm interviewing him
for the movie as well, yeah.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.290
- I may or may not have
had a calendar of him

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.859
when I was 16 on my wall.

00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:36.692
(audience laughing)

00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:37.650
- Dreams do come true.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.483
- They do.

00:00:38.483 --> 00:00:39.360
They really, really do.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.097
And so when the director
called me and he was just like,

00:00:42.097 --> 00:00:44.467
"We'd love to have you
back for the second movie."

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:47.470
"How do you feel about
playing opposite Shemar Moore?

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.018
Then there was a Natasha size
hole in my wall where I ran.

00:00:50.018 --> 00:00:51.860
(audience laughing)

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.270
He's like, we're not shooting just yet.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.693
And then I ran back home and I was like,

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:55.526
"Alright cool."

00:00:55.526 --> 00:00:57.440
- [Kelly] I'm ready.
- I'm ready, let's do it.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.950
- You are so funny in the first one.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.190
So I just, literally I love
when people make films like this

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.830
that are for kids and adults.
- [Natasha] Yeah.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:05.972
- We all enjoy it at the same time.

00:01:05.972 --> 00:01:07.230
- It's for everybody.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.927
- It's really cool of y'all to do for us.

00:01:09.927 --> 00:01:10.760
(Natasha laughing)

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.190
Cause some of them aren't for adults,

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:14.737
and you're like, "Oh my gosh," yeah.

